{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"agent_message","text":"The collision guard now preserves segment identity, and blocked entries retain resource IDs while polling resolves handles. The tests cover both rejection and identical reloads, plus EDN round-trips and wake-up for readers and writers. I’m checking the shared scheduler for regressions; JVM testing hit the read-only sandbox’s cache restriction, so I’m validating with Babashka."}}
